  "findings": [
    "Runtime SessionIndexEntry adds local-only title, pendingExecution and hasPendingPrompt versus personal.ts; title is excluded only from wire projections.",
    "Shared queued prompts add source; runtime constrains options.effortLevel. Runtime and protocol index fixtures stay separate to expose this divergence.",
